- **Controls Reference Panel:** Side panel clearly showing standard controls:
  - `ArrowLeft`: Move Left
  - `ArrowRight`: Move Right
  - `ArrowDown`: Soft Drop
  - Restart Button: Click to Restart (no keyboard shortcut bound)
